{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219260","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521926001:0":{"text":"*Sobbing* Aunt Nanri!","source_cn":"呜呜呜呜……南茜阿姨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD51CB5FEA265D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521926002:1":{"text":"Renee... oh, sweetheart... why are you still here?","source_cn":"蕾妮，蕾妮……可怜的孩子，你怎么还在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CB768010EF30D2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521926003:1":{"text":"Your mother told me you'd be with the last evacuation group... You didn't make it out?","source_cn":"我明明记得你妈妈和我说过，你们会在最后撤离的那支队伍里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46DD187B0377D3AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521926004:1":{"text":"*Sobbing* I-I don't know...","source_cn":"呜呜呜……我、我不知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5A514044D7D3BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521926005:1":{"text":"After we left town, it got dark... then Mom grabbed my hand and started running...","source_cn":"妈妈带我离开镇子以后，天就黑了……然后，然后妈妈就拉着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34D121C0A2FA372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521926006:1":{"text":"But so many people were falling! Mom... Mom fell too! She couldn't stand up... she crawled on the ground, just like... just like those monsters chasing me earlier...!","source_cn":"但是好多人都摔倒了！妈妈……妈妈也摔倒了！她站不起来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59BA8849FA908A76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1521926006":{"text":"But so many people were falling! Mom... Mom fell too! She couldn't stand up... she crawled on the ground, just like... just like those monsters chasing me earlier...!","source_cn":"但是好多人都摔倒了！妈妈……妈妈也摔倒了！她站不起来，就在地上爬，像……像刚才追我的那些怪物一样……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59BA8849FA908A76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521926007:1":{"text":"Then how... how did you get away?","source_cn":"那你……你是怎么从这里逃出去的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA09CBAABBED09C9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521926008:1":{"text":"They saved me... They couldn't speak anymore, but they still remembered me... They pushed me out...","source_cn":"是大家救了我……大家虽然说不出话了，但还记得我……是他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9D7524C528B73EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521926009:1":{"text":"... And then... then they... *Sobbing*","source_cn":"……之后，他们也、也……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70A7A5DA5F9A559E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521926010:1":{"text":"They pushed you into the light. That's why the corruption didn't reach you.","source_cn":"是那些人把你推出了黑暗，所以你才没有受到神堕的影响。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E8BB188BE893F0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521926011:1":{"text":"I don't know... I just kept running and running, until I found a house...","source_cn":"不知道……我只知道我跑了好久好久，才找到一间房子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A995DF00FDA606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521926012:1":{"text":"There was a kind old woman living there. She gave me food, clothes... But later, there was nothing left to eat. And then... she too...","source_cn":"那里住着一个奶奶，她给我吃的，给我衣服……可是后来，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC929F6D50BE47AC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521926013:1":{"text":"I... I didn't know where to go. I just wanted to find Mom and Dad... but they were gone. Tuttleton was gone too!","source_cn":"我……我没有地方去，所以想找妈妈，找爸爸……但是他们都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B7FD8DAE2CC0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521926014:1":{"text":"Aunt Nanri, where are they? I want to see them... *Sobbing*","source_cn":"南茜阿姨，爸爸妈妈在哪？我想找他们……呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB457FD5B95B821B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521926015:1":{"text":"Poor Renee... Aunt Nanri's right here...","source_cn":"可怜的蕾妮，南茜阿姨在这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7C7A82B36A3833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521926016:1":{"text":"It's okay now...","source_cn":"不哭……不哭了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF915E47BFD7DFD0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Corruption from the fallen god.","source_cn":"是丰饶神带来的堕化","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07150B994E42ECCE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Corruption from the fallen god.","female":"Corruption from the fallen god.","variant_male_record_index":"78647","variant_female_record_index":"78648","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"The god corrupted the villagers.","source_cn":"那些镇民被神堕影响了…